This directory is expected to contain the binary versions of the Minimacy Virtual Machine:

- minimacy.exe    : windows version
- minimacy        : linux without GUI
- minimacyX11     : linux with X11
- minimacyX11GL   : linux with X11 and openGL
- minimacyRPiOS64 : raspberry Pi OS 64 bits with X11 and openGL
- minimacyMac     : macos command line without GUI
- minimacyMacX11  : macos command line with X11
- minimacyMacX11GL: macos command line with X11 and openGL (not working on Tahoe)
- minimacyRpi4.img: baremetal raspberry Pi 4

Binary for MM-2350 is built in: ./baremetal/raspberry-2350/build/minimacy.uf2
We are manually copying and renaming it here as: minimacyMM2350.uf2

In order to build these binaries, see: https://github.com/ambermind/minimacy/blob/main/README.md
